# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Kitchen Table Cabinetry - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Analytics 4
# Get your Measurement ID from: https://analytics.google.com
# Format: G-XXXXXXXXXX
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Formspree - Contact Form Submissions  (REQUIRED for forms to work)
# This is where ALL contact + landing-page leads are delivered.
#   1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
#   2. Set its notification email to your inbox (e.g. info@kitchentablecabinetry.com)
#   3. Paste the form ID below (the part after /f/ in the endpoint URL)
# If this is unset, the forms show an error instead of sending leads to an
# unknown account.
# Format: xyzabcde
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=xyzabcde

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Meta (Facebook) Pixel - Ad campaign conversion tracking
# Powers Lead optimization + reporting for the Facebook ad campaign.
# Get your Pixel ID from Meta Events Manager:
#   https://business.facebook.com/events_manager
# Format: 15-16 digit number, e.g. 1234567890123456
# Leave unset to disable the Pixel entirely (no tracking scripts load).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_FB_PIXEL_ID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Maps API Key (Optional - for embedded map)
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com
# Required APIs: Maps JavaScript API, Places API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Site Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://kitchentablecabinetry.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Kitchen Table Cabinetry
